[en.DECISION_C08_INVESTIGATE_PLUSH_TOYS]
Investigate Plush Toys

[en.DECISION_C08_INVESTIGATE_PLUSH_TOYS_desc]
Although we can be quite sure that plush toys have absolutely nothing to do with the Empire’s Operation 「Greenlight」.
But strangely, whether we are investigating Canterlot™ or investigating fire safety experts, we will find traces of plush toys... This high correlation is definitely not a coincidence.

[zh.DECISION_C08_INVESTIGATE_PLUSH_TOYS]
调查毛绒玩具

[zh.DECISION_C08_INVESTIGATE_PLUSH_TOYS_desc]
虽然我们可以比较确信，毛绒玩具与帝国的「绿灯」行动绝对没有任何关联。
但奇怪的是，无论我们在调查坎特洛特™还是在调查消防安全专家，我们都会发现毛绒玩具的踪迹... 这种高度关联绝对不是巧合。
